+- Do not handle missing or malformed input: a call the schema rejects never reaches the executor. The registry returns the rejection to the model as the tool result so it can correct the call on its next round
+- Undeclared extra keys can still be present on `input` -- the schema does not reject them, so ignore them unless you read them deliberately
 
